; Generic movie template derived from 鸽子样式β2.7.1.
; Every size, margin and border below is in 1080p units. PlayRes stays 1920x1080 for
; 4K, 1080p and 720p 16:9 video; the renderer scales the canvas to the frame, so text
; covers the same share of the picture at every resolution.
; For other aspect ratios keep PlayResX 1920 and set PlayResY = round(1920 * height / width)
; (1920x800 and 3840x1600 scope video both get 800), so the type stays tied to the width.
; libass does not wrap Chinese text on its own, so vstudio render breaks lines with \N.
; At size 62 a line holds about 27 Chinese characters inside the 120 px side margins.
